{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/ec5b093f6654b950098cd600a4ff88a7.webp?t=1761584722\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Terror is an episodic psychological horror game where each episode unravels a different horror tale.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forbidden Terror: Board Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of Forbidden Terror, you take the role of Jonah, an 18 year old living with his parents. Jonah and his parents moved into a new house that they acquired for a very low price after a family was brutally murdered there and no one else was willing to live in it. Jonah and his best friend Emily, who is a huge fan of horror films, discover an Ouija Board at their local convenience store and bring it home for fun. They had no idea it was more than a simple board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/7d149a1cf60979d60177d7f3c887bd86.poster.avif?t=1761584722\" width=834 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/7d149a1cf60979d60177d7f3c887bd86.webm?t=1761584722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/7d149a1cf60979d60177d7f3c887bd86.mp4?t=1761584722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to fully immerse you in the story of the narrator. It is primarily an atmospheric, psychological horror, first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and conversation mechanics. It features photo-realistic graphics, immersive environmental design and a cinematic aesthetic.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gentleman's Behavior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994530/f0e60e46c6b883faf3e6f26e7d5c64ff3e96cee2.jpg"},{"name":"Tale Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994530/6bc7dc9948ca7bac789b36edb19e391509e2faff.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994530?t=1761584722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/399d58bded264125f288d423595d113ff02e8085/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761584722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/0b2a8571f6ab73f4a884a84ef0ef6acb55fed04d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761584722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/0b2a8571f6ab73f4a884a84ef0ef6acb55fed04d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761584722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content such as gore and flickering lights that could be disturbing for certain players."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/ec5b093f6654b950098cd600a4ff88a7.webp?t=1761584722\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Terror is an episodic psychological horror game where each episode unravels a different horror tale.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forbidden Terror: Board Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of Forbidden Terror, you take the role of Jonah, an 18 year old living with his parents. Jonah and his parents moved into a new house that they acquired for a very low price after a family was brutally murdered there and no one else was willing to live in it. Jonah and his best friend Emily, who is a huge fan of horror films, discover an Ouija Board at their local convenience store and bring it home for fun. They had no idea it was more than a simple board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/7d149a1cf60979d60177d7f3c887bd86.poster.avif?t=1761584722\" width=834 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/7d149a1cf60979d60177d7f3c887bd86.webm?t=1761584722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/extras/7d149a1cf60979d60177d7f3c887bd86.mp4?t=1761584722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to fully immerse you in the story of the narrator. It is primarily an atmospheric, psychological horror, first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and conversation mechanics. It features photo-realistic graphics, immersive environmental design and a cinematic aesthetic.</p>","developers":["Elite Lords Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994530/51abfe736c5ba15b15d6f2ea441bd7b6ffa9a483/header.jpg?t=1761584722","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994530/333831861/40060fdb1e0cae2c209bd70f